## Goal
Do the treated samples (B1-B3) and untreated samples (A1-A3) separate on a principal
component analysis of the gene-level counts? The analysis produces a PCA of all six samples,
coloured by `condition`, so the separation (or lack of it) can be judged by eye. It reports
what was computed; interpreting it is left to the reader.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

| Artifact type | Resolved from | Path |
